error: `x` is bound by a test, and seen only where that test is known to have held
 --> what_an_expect_binds_is_not_seen_in_its_else.fn:5:36
  |
5 |   expect xs is [x, *_] else return x
  |                                    ^ not known to hold here
  |
  = help: a test binds along its `&` chain, into `then`, and for the lines below an `expect`; under `|`, `!` or in `else`, it may not have held
